<title>NEW ZEALAND: Ports of Auck half yr result due Feb 18.</title>
<headline>Ports of Auck half yr result due Feb 18.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ports of Auckland said on Wednesday it would release its financial results for the half year ended December 31 at 11.00 a.m. (2200 GMT) on February 18.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
